# The portal's connection to SkillForge: all three or none. Without them the login page says the portal is not
# configured; part of them, a URL with a path or a value with whitespace stops the server at start.
# Locally: a SkillForge on http://localhost:8000 and a client seeded with `just bootstrap-client` (admin helper spec,
# SS3). Never a hosted SkillForge from an agent session.
SKILLFORGE_API_URL=
SKILLFORGE_CLIENT_ID=
SKILLFORGE_CLIENT_SECRET=
